Depends: ${perl:Depends}
# Only blackboxtest's DHCP steps need scapy, and dhcp.py imports it inside scapy_module(),
# which raises UnsupportedError naming this package when the import fails. So xcat-test
# installs and every other step runs without it, which is why xCAT-test.spec has only ever
# recommended it. A hard Depends: also pulls scapy's own recommends -- matplotlib, scipy and
# ipython3, about 255 MB over 54 packages -- into a CI step capped at 1200 seconds.
Recommends: python3-scapy
Description: xCAT automated test tool
 Provides automated test tool and buckets to help test xCAT commands
 automatically.
